{"unit_id":"SUZUNAMI__dsh-workspace-hide#card-zh","repo":"SUZUNAMI/dsh-workspace-hide","commit":"3ac830e2825aec5248b095728239cab10bed827c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-hide 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的工作区显示管理插件，在设置页提供工作区开关并过滤侧边栏列表。关闭某行可隐藏该工作区，并把其中原先未归档的会话收起，避免它们落入未分组列表；重新显示时恢复这次归档的会话。支持逐项切换、显示全部、失效记录清理和恢复失败重试。隐藏清单保存在浏览器本地，工作区文件和会话记录不被删除。需要实际归档与恢复时，需有提供取消归档能力的 archive-manager。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:345-359","lib/client.js:597-653","lib/client.js:899-969"]}
{"unit_id":"SUZUNAMI__dsh-workspace-hide#card-en","repo":"SUZUNAMI/dsh-workspace-hide","commit":"3ac830e2825aec5248b095728239cab10bed827c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-workspace-hide adds workspace switches to DSH Web Settings. Hidden workspaces leave the sidebar and their sessions stay out of the ungrouped list. Showing them restores sessions archived by that action. The list is stored in browser localStorage; host archiving needs an unarchive service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:345-359","lib/client.js:597-653","lib/client.js:899-969"]}
