{"unit_id":"SUZUNAMI__dsh-workspace-hide#feature-workspace-visibility","repo":"SUZUNAMI/dsh-workspace-hide","commit":"3ac830e2825aec5248b095728239cab10bed827c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-hide 的功能「工作区侧边栏显隐」：在设置页切换工作区开关，隐藏项从侧边栏列表移除并沉到管理列表底部；再次打开可恢复显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:345-359","lib/client.js:899-969"]}
{"unit_id":"SUZUNAMI__dsh-workspace-hide#feature-archive-sessions","repo":"SUZUNAMI/dsh-workspace-hide","commit":"3ac830e2825aec5248b095728239cab10bed827c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-hide 的功能「隐藏时收起会话」：插件把该工作区中尚未归档的会话标记为隐藏，并在具备恢复能力时调用宿主归档；恢复时只处理本次隐藏归档的会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:597-636"]}
{"unit_id":"SUZUNAMI__dsh-workspace-hide#feature-restore-management","repo":"SUZUNAMI/dsh-workspace-hide","commit":"3ac830e2825aec5248b095728239cab10bed827c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-hide 的功能「批量恢复与失败重试」：设置页的“显示全部”恢复所有隐藏工作区及相关会话；取消归档失败的会话可重试或从待恢复列表移除。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:643-665","lib/client.js:934-944"]}
{"unit_id":"SUZUNAMI__dsh-workspace-hide#feature-local-persistence","repo":"SUZUNAMI/dsh-workspace-hide","commit":"3ac830e2825aec5248b095728239cab10bed827c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-hide 的功能「本地保存隐藏清单」：插件将隐藏工作区及归档会话 ID 写入浏览器 localStorage，并支持从旧版清单迁移。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:225-277"]}
{"unit_id":"SUZUNAMI__dsh-workspace-hide#caveat-optional-restore","repo":"SUZUNAMI/dsh-workspace-hide","commit":"3ac830e2825aec5248b095728239cab10bed827c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-hide 使用前须知：只有检测到提供取消归档能力的 workspaceRegistry 时，才会把会话真正归档到宿主；缺少该能力时仅在侧边栏隐藏显示，取消隐藏即可显示回来。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:597-625","lib/client.js:1009-1029"]}
